  riga 8: CAPABILITY Scrivi(FORM: String)
  riga 9: STATE testo : MEANING INITIAL ""
  riga 10: GUARANTEE REDUCES: VERBAL "un campo come id" VERIFY BY JUDGEMENT "l'operatore"
  riga 12: SCENARIO TO EXPECT ADMITTED
  riga 14: @0 arrivo(SOURCE: "x")

6. TIPI NON DICHIARATI: 0

7. CSC NOMINATE E NON CONTROLLATE: 0

